<item><title>Leer police hold five men over alleged hospital thefts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/leer-police-hold-five-men-over-alleged-hospital-thefts-e85d1a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/leer-police-hold-five-men-over-alleged-hospital-thefts-e85d1a/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The suspects are accused of taking money, phones and other property from a hospital in Unity State, and no recoveries have been reported.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:17:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>South Sudan state seeks leads after more than 200 cattle go missing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-state-seeks-leads-after-more-than-200-cattle-go-b39562/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-state-seeks-leads-after-more-than-200-cattle-go-b39562/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The herd was attacked near Torit after being moved from Kapoeta to escape drought and food shortages in their grazing areas.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:08:57 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Kiir orders forces to clear roadblocks on aid routes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-orders-forces-to-clear-roadblocks-on-aid-routes-fa549f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-orders-forces-to-clear-roadblocks-on-aid-routes-fa549f/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>A November 25 order also bars unauthorised fees that delay humanitarian convoys and diplomatic shipments moving across South Sudan.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:30:48 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-orders-forces-to-clear-roadblocks-on-aid-routes-fa549f/share.jpg" length="39756" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-orders-forces-to-clear-roadblocks-on-aid-routes-fa549f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Wau security restrictions keep some voters from registration</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/wau-security-restrictions-keep-some-voters-from-registration-9f3d4b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/wau-security-restrictions-keep-some-voters-from-registration-9f3d4b/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>South Sudan’s elections commission says some centres lack materials, with the nationwide registration period ending on November 28.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:32:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
